2,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l22-p12-b1","partTitle":"Your turn 5/5","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Ils sont jolis !</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">They're pretty!</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Oui, j'aime les papillons.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">Yes, I like butterflies.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"Your turn! Say your line.","expectedText":"Oui, j'aime les papillons.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234590,"_nanoseconds":985000000}},{"id":"g2QyaQKBwx8V8bFRtgCv","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":22,"part":13,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l22-p13-b1","partTitle":"Speak freely","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><p style=\"font-size:1.4rem;margin:6px 0;\"><b>Tu es dans le jardin. Qu'est-ce que tu vois ?</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.75;margin:0 0 10px;\">You're in the garden. What do you see?</p><p><b>Say two things you see.</b></p><p style=\"opacity:.7;\">For example: “Je vois une fleur. Je vois un papillon jaune.”</p></div>","recordPrompt":"Now it's your turn to speak!","expectedText":"Je vois une fleur. Je vois un papillon jaune.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234591,"_nanoseconds":171000000}},{"id":"km5wyis8RwoHnwCCkA4r","level":"a0-les-petits","lesson":22,"part":14,"type":"text","name":"ab-kids-l22-p14-b1","partTitle":"Well done","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:64px;line-height:1.1;\">🦋</div><p><b>Garden explorer!</b></p></div><p style=\"line-height:1.6;\">🧑‍🏫 You can describe a garden: je vois un arbre, je vois un oiseau bleu.</p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793234591,"_nanoseconds":226000000}}]